This directory exists so `nginx/paid-cert/` is present after `git clone`/`git pull`.

Place the purchased certificate here manually on each server — these files
are gitignored and never committed:

  nginx/paid-cert/waytuk.ru.crt   — the certificate, WITH the intermediate
                                     chain appended (leaf cert first, then
                                     any intermediate CA certs, all in one
                                     file, in that order)
  nginx/paid-cert/waytuk.ru.key   — the private key, unencrypted (no
                                     passphrase)

Both are plain PEM text (-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE----- / -----BEGIN PRIVATE
KEY----- blocks). Get them from the Timeweb Cloud panel: "Домены и SSL" →
"SSL-сертификаты" → click the certificate → copy the CRT and Private Key
fields into these two files.

nginx.conf expects exactly these two filenames for the waytuk.ru server
block. If you ever swap in a differently-named certificate, update
nginx/nginx.conf to match.
